From 1534db25f7acc5e072e777fe665e9de66238a9ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jacky Chou <jacky_chou@aspeedtech.com>
Date: Tue, 5 May 2026 13:30:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm: mach-aspeed: add AST2705 SoC support

Add CONFIG_ASPEED_AST2705 Kconfig option as a standalone SoC choice,
separate from AST2700. Wire in the ast2705 machine directory covering
low-level init, clock, SPI, SDRAM, MMU, CPU info and SCU info.

Upstream-Status: Backport [SDK v11.03 migration]
Signed-off-by: Jacky Chou <jacky_chou@aspeedtech.com>
Change-Id: I32ce21cf2a89aecfbd79b4b0358a332ef9acbd3e
Signed-off-by: rupeshs <rupeshs@ami.com>
---
